<!-- tutorial.uikitml -->
<style>
  .root {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 24;
    gap: 12;
    background-color: rgba(2, 8, 24, 0.94);
    border-radius: 16;
    border-color: rgba(255, 180, 50, 0.4);
    border-width: 2;
    width: 340;
  }
  .heading {
    font-size: 24;
    color: #ffb432;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .step-row {
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 10;
    width: 300;
    padding-top: 6;
    padding-bottom: 6;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .step-num {
    font-size: 20;
    color: #ffb432;
    font-weight: bold;
    width: 30;
  }
  .step-text {
    font-size: 13;
    color: rgba(220, 230, 240, 0.9);
  }
  .tip-box {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4;
    width: 300;
    padding: 10;
    background-color: rgba(255, 180, 50, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8;
    border-color: rgba(255, 180, 50, 0.2);
    border-width: 1;
  }
  .tip-heading {
    font-size: 13;
    color: #ffb432;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .tip-text {
    font-size: 11;
    color: rgba(200, 210, 220, 0.8);
  }
  .btn {
    padding: 12;
    background-color: rgba(255, 180, 50, 0.15);
    border-radius: 8;
    border-color: rgba(255, 180, 50, 0.3);
    border-width: 1;
    width: 260;
    align-items: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-top: 6;
  }
  .btn-text {
    font-size: 16;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>
<Panel class="root">
  <div class="heading">HOW TO PLAY</div>
  <div class="step-row">
    <div class="step-num">1</div>
    <div class="step-text">Aim your controller to direct the lighthouse beam across the dark ocean</div>
  </div>
  <div class="step-row">
    <div class="step-num">2</div>
    <div class="step-text">Illuminate approaching ships so they can navigate safely to the harbor</div>
  </div>
  <div class="step-row">
    <div class="step-num">3</div>
    <div class="step-text">Ships in the beam turn toward the harbor dock. Without light they drift into rocks</div>
  </div>
  <div class="step-row">
    <div class="step-num">4</div>
    <div class="step-text">Each wave brings more ships from different directions. Save them all for bonus points</div>
  </div>
  <div class="tip-box">
    <div class="tip-heading">TIP</div>
    <div class="tip-text">Watch for red navigation lights to spot ships in the darkness. Sweep your beam across the sea regularly.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="btn" id="btn-got-it">
    <div class="btn-text">GOT IT</div>
  </div>
</Panel>
